  "description": "XUSGAW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C66 H76 N4 Nd4 O32 Zn2,2(C1 H6 Cl2 O2 Zn1),4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.402-4.122 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.62-112.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn2Nd4L2(OAc)10(OH)2(CH3OH)2]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 10 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 10 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
